### ============================================
### VER HORARIO COMPLETO
### ============================================

### Horario del docente 25
GET http://localhost:8000/api/gestion-academica/horario?id_docente=25

### Horario del curso 1 (Quinto A)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/gestion-academica/horario?id_curso=1

### Horario del Lunes (id_dia_semana=1)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/gestion-academica/horario?id_dia_semana=1
